# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0

# Premise. A facility agreement binds a borrower to a syndicate of lenders.
# Its clauses say what each side must, must not, may and can do, and they say
# it twice: once on the lender's form, in terms of roles ("the Borrower", "the
# Lenders"), and once for a particular facility, in terms of the parties who
# signed it. The form's meaning is shared by every facility drawn from it. A
# facility's meaning is built from the form's for that facility alone.
#
# The form's clauses:
#
# | Clause | Text | Meaning |
# |--------|------|---------|
# | 6.1    | The Borrower shall repay each loan to the Lenders, each for its share. | an obligation owed to a group, severally |
# | 7.1    | The Borrower shall ensure, for the Lenders and the Security Trustee, leverage does not exceed 3.0 to 1. | a continuing obligation, one beneficiary no party |
# | 8.1    | The Borrower shall not create security over its assets, except a lien arising by operation of law. | one term, two relations: a prohibition (the negative pledge) and the permission excepting it |
# | 10.1   | The Lenders may declare all loans immediately due and payable. | a power held by the group |
#
# The facility for Acme Holdings plc (FA-2027-0419) has two lenders, holding
# 60% and 40% of the commitments, and a security trustee who is no party to it.
#
# What the example shows:
#
# | Construct                                            | Where                                                  |
# |------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------|
# | stated meaning on the form, owned by its clauses     | tmpl:*, each term ins:expressedIn a clause             |
# | bound meaning for one facility, owned by it          | ex:*, each term ins:boundIn ex:facility-v1             |
# | a relation belongs to its term, and through it to the term's owner | ins:arisesUnder                          |
# | one term with two relations                          | tmpl:term-8-1, ex:term-8-1                             |
# | each bound node from the stated node it binds        | ins:boundFrom                                          |
# | an obligation owed to a group, severally             | ex:repay → ex:lenders (pty:SeveralOnly)                |
# | a continuing obligation and the state it keeps       | ex:leverage, ins:maintains ex:leverage-ok              |
# | a prohibition and the permission excepting it        | ex:negative-pledge, ex:permitted-liens                 |
# | a power held by a group                              | ex:accelerate                                          |
# | the instrument's parties, and a beneficiary who is not one | ins:party, ex:trustee-occ                        |
# | an instrument's natural keys                         | ex:facility-identity                                   |
#
# Why terms exist: a term is the provision the parties are bound by. Clause
# 8.1 is one provision giving rise to two relations. Later slices attach to the
# term what belongs to the whole provision: its classification (a condition or
# a warranty) and survival (C7b), the sections it applies within (C7b), its
# precedence, and qualifiers such as limits (C8). Definitions and deemings
# arise under terms without being relations (C7b).
#
# Arising, due and ending (C7b), the regime that gates acceleration on an
# event of default (C7a), and the consent rule for joint exercise (C9) are
# added by later slices. Nothing here evaluates.

@prefix ins:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#> .
@prefix ins-voc: <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument/vocab#> .
@prefix wrd:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/wording#> .
@prefix wrd-voc: <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/wording/vocab#> .
@prefix fnd:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/foundation#> .
@prefix pty:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#> .
@prefix elg:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/eligibility#> .
@prefix qnt:     <https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/quantification#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix keys:    <https://example.org/lattice/foundation/keys#> .
@prefix tmpl:    <https://example.org/lattice/instrument/facility/form/> .
@prefix ex:      <https://example.org/lattice/instrument/facility/> .

# ==== The lender's form: wording =============================================

ex:form a wrd:Wording ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:form-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:directlyComprises ex:sec-6 , ex:sec-7 , ex:sec-8 , ex:sec-10 .

ex:sec-6 a wrd:Element ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:sec-6-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Section ; wrd:objectId "6" ; wrd:rankKey "f0" ;
    wrd:directlyComprises ex:cl-6-1 .
ex:cl-6-1 a wrd:Text ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:cl-6-1-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Clause ; wrd:objectId "6.1" ; wrd:rankKey "a0" ;
    wrd:inclusionMode wrd-voc:Mandatory ;
    wrd:hasTextPart [ a wrd:TextPart ; wrd:partIndex 0 ;
        wrd:partText "The Borrower shall repay each loan to the Lenders, each for its share." ] .

ex:sec-7 a wrd:Element ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:sec-7-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Section ; wrd:objectId "7" ; wrd:rankKey "g0" ;
    wrd:directlyComprises ex:cl-7-1 .
ex:cl-7-1 a wrd:Text ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:cl-7-1-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Clause ; wrd:objectId "7.1" ; wrd:rankKey "a0" ;
    wrd:inclusionMode wrd-voc:Mandatory ;
    wrd:hasTextPart [ a wrd:TextPart ; wrd:partIndex 0 ;
        wrd:partText "The Borrower shall ensure, for the benefit of the Lenders and the Security Trustee, that leverage does not exceed 3.0 to 1." ] .

ex:sec-8 a wrd:Element ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:sec-8-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Section ; wrd:objectId "8" ; wrd:rankKey "h0" ;
    wrd:directlyComprises ex:cl-8-1 .
ex:cl-8-1 a wrd:Text ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:cl-8-1-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Clause ; wrd:objectId "8.1" ; wrd:rankKey "a0" ;
    wrd:inclusionMode wrd-voc:Mandatory ;
    wrd:hasTextPart [ a wrd:TextPart ; wrd:partIndex 0 ;
        wrd:partText "The Borrower shall not create any security over any of its assets, except a lien arising by operation of law." ] .

ex:sec-10 a wrd:Element ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:sec-10-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Section ; wrd:objectId "10" ; wrd:rankKey "j0" ;
    wrd:directlyComprises ex:cl-10-1 .
ex:cl-10-1 a wrd:Text ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:cl-10-1-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:elementType wrd-voc:Clause ; wrd:objectId "10.1" ; wrd:rankKey "a0" ;
    wrd:inclusionMode wrd-voc:Mandatory ;
    wrd:hasTextPart [ a wrd:TextPart ; wrd:partIndex 0 ;
        wrd:partText "The Lenders may by notice declare all loans immediately due and payable." ] .

# ==== The form's roles =======================================================

ex:Borrower a pty:Role ; rdfs:label "Borrower" .
ex:Lender a pty:Role ; rdfs:label "Lender" .
ex:SecurityTrustee a pty:Role ; rdfs:label "Security Trustee" .

# ==== Stated meaning: owned by the form's clauses ============================
#
# Each stated term is part of exactly one element version, the clause that
# expresses it (law I2). Its relations belong to it (ins:arisesUnder), name
# roles, never occupancies (I13), and are never evaluated.
#
# Clause 6.1 says the Lenders are owed "each for its share", but a role cannot
# say how its occupants act together. That is stated in C7b, by a defined
# party word ("the Lenders") whose definition carries the mode. Until then
# only the bound group says it (pty:SeveralOnly).

tmpl:term-6-1 a ins:Term , ins:Template ; ins:expressedIn ex:cl-6-1 .
tmpl:repay a ins:Obligation , ins:Template ;
    ins:arisesUnder tmpl:term-6-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:Borrower ;
    ins:obligee ex:Lender ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:Repay .

tmpl:term-7-1 a ins:Term , ins:Template ; ins:expressedIn ex:cl-7-1 .
tmpl:leverage a ins:ContinuingObligation , ins:Template ;
    ins:arisesUnder tmpl:term-7-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:Borrower ;
    ins:obligee ex:Lender , ex:SecurityTrustee ;
    ins:maintains ex:leverage-ok .

# One provision, two relations: the prohibition and its exception.
tmpl:term-8-1 a ins:Term , ins:Template ; ins:expressedIn ex:cl-8-1 .
tmpl:negative-pledge a ins:Prohibition , ins:Template ;
    ins:arisesUnder tmpl:term-8-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:Borrower ;
    ins:obligee ex:Lender ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:CreateSecurity .
tmpl:permitted-liens a ins:Permission , ins:Template ;
    ins:arisesUnder tmpl:term-8-1 ;
    ins:holder ex:Borrower ;                      # the excepted prohibition's obligor (I8)
    ins:counterparty ex:Lender ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:CreateSecurity ;         # the same activity (I8)
    ins:excepts tmpl:negative-pledge ;
    ins:scope ex:lien-by-law .

tmpl:term-10-1 a ins:Term , ins:Template ; ins:expressedIn ex:cl-10-1 .
tmpl:accelerate a ins:Power , ins:Template ;
    ins:arisesUnder tmpl:term-10-1 ;
    ins:holder ex:Lender ;
    ins:counterparty ex:Borrower ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:DeclareDue .

# ==== Conditions the meaning reads ===========================================

ex:leverage-space a qnt:ValueSpace ;
    qnt:spaceKey "leverage-ratio" ; qnt:orderKind qnt:TotalOrder ; qnt:densityKind qnt:Dense ;
    qnt:spaceHash "leverage-ratio-v1" .
ex:three a qnt:Quantity ; qnt:onSpace ex:leverage-space ; qnt:numericValue "3.0"^^xsd:decimal .
ex:at-most-three a qnt:Bound ;
    qnt:onSpace ex:leverage-space ; qnt:boundValue ex:three ; qnt:boundSense qnt:Upper ; qnt:boundClosure qnt:Closed .
ex:up-to-three a qnt:Range ; qnt:onSpace ex:leverage-space ; qnt:upperBound ex:at-most-three ; qnt:hasBound ex:at-most-three .
ex:permitted-leverage a qnt:RangeSet ; qnt:onSpace ex:leverage-space ; qnt:hasRange ex:up-to-three .

ex:leverage-ok a elg:IntervalCondition ;
    elg:conditionKey "leverage-within-covenant" ;
    elg:matchStrategy elg:IntervalContainment ;
    elg:compatibilityOperation elg:AllRequired ;
    elg:wildcardSemantics elg:NoWildcard ;
    elg:requiredRangeSet ex:permitted-leverage .

# Placeholder: a scope stated, not yet evaluable. Its concept is in no scheme
# and no evidence binding reads it, until the case data exists (C7b, C13).
ex:lien-by-law a elg:Condition ;
    elg:conditionKey "lien-arising-by-operation-of-law" ;
    elg:matchStrategy elg:ExactMatch ;
    elg:compatibilityOperation elg:AllRequired ;
    elg:wildcardSemantics elg:NoWildcard ;
    elg:requiredConcept ex:by-operation-of-law .
ex:by-operation-of-law a skos:Concept ; rdfs:label "a security interest arising by operation of law" .

# ==== The facility for Acme: wording and instrument ==========================

ex:acme-wording-v1 a wrd:AssembledWording ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:acme-wording-identity ; fnd:hasGovernanceState fnd:Active ;
    wrd:assembledFrom ex:form ;
    wrd:includes ex:sec-6 , ex:cl-6-1 , ex:sec-7 , ex:cl-7-1 , ex:sec-8 , ex:cl-8-1 , ex:sec-10 , ex:cl-10-1 .

# ins:party lists the parties to the instrument, as authored: who signs it.
# It is not derived from the relations' parties, since a relation may name a
# beneficiary or a regulator who is no party (CC-Q4), and every party executes
# separately (S90, C9).
ex:facility-v1 a ins:Instrument ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:facility-identity ;
    ins:expressedIn ex:acme-wording-v1 ;              # exactly one assembled wording (I1)
    ins:party ex:borrower-occ , ex:lender-1-occ , ex:lender-2-occ .

# The facility's names, given by the world: natural keys on its identity,
# from the schemes Foundation's keys example declares. Their IRIs are what
# those schemes' natural-key recipe mints from the values.
ex:facility-identity a fnd:PersistentIdentity , fnd:NaturallyKeyed ;
    fnd:naturalKey <https://example.org/lattice/foundation/keys/key/agreement-number/FA-2027-0419> ,
                   <https://example.org/lattice/foundation/keys/key/market-reference/MR-2027-000419> .
<https://example.org/lattice/foundation/keys/key/agreement-number/FA-2027-0419> a fnd:Key , keys:AgreementNumberKey ;
    fnd:keyScheme keys:agreement-number ; fnd:keyValue "FA-2027-0419" .
<https://example.org/lattice/foundation/keys/key/market-reference/MR-2027-000419> a fnd:Key , keys:MarketReferenceKey ;
    fnd:keyScheme keys:market-reference ; fnd:keyValue "MR-2027-000419" .

# ==== The parties of this facility, and one who is not a party ===============

ex:acme a pty:Actor ; rdfs:label "Acme Holdings plc" .
ex:north-bank a pty:Actor ; rdfs:label "North Bank plc" .
ex:south-bank a pty:Actor ; rdfs:label "South Bank SA" .
ex:harbour-trustees a pty:Actor ; rdfs:label "Harbour Trustees Ltd" .

ex:borrower-occ a pty:RoleOccupancy ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:borrower-occ-identity ;
    fnd:hasTemporalScope [ a fnd:TemporalScope ; fnd:validFrom "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ] ;
    pty:inRole ex:Borrower ;
    pty:occupiedBy ex:acme .
ex:lender-1-occ a pty:RoleOccupancy ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:lender-1-occ-identity ;
    fnd:hasTemporalScope [ a fnd:TemporalScope ; fnd:validFrom "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ] ;
    pty:inRole ex:Lender ;
    pty:occupiedBy ex:north-bank .
ex:lender-2-occ a pty:RoleOccupancy ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:lender-2-occ-identity ;
    fnd:hasTemporalScope [ a fnd:TemporalScope ; fnd:validFrom "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ] ;
    pty:inRole ex:Lender ;
    pty:occupiedBy ex:south-bank .

# The security trustee holds the leverage covenant's benefit for the lenders,
# but signs a separate deed, not this agreement: an obligee, not a party.
ex:trustee-occ a pty:RoleOccupancy ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:trustee-occ-identity ;
    fnd:hasTemporalScope [ a fnd:TemporalScope ; fnd:validFrom "2027-01-01T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ] ;
    pty:inRole ex:SecurityTrustee ;
    pty:occupiedBy ex:harbour-trustees .

# The lenders as a group: each is owed its own share, and only its share.
ex:lenders a pty:ParticipationGroup ;
    fnd:hasIdentity ex:lenders-identity ;
    pty:hasCompositionRule pty:SeveralOnly ;
    pty:hasParticipant ex:lender-1-share , ex:lender-2-share .
ex:lender-1-share a pty:GroupMembership ;
    pty:memberOf ex:lenders ; pty:memberOccupancy ex:lender-1-occ ; pty:share "0.6"^^xsd:decimal .
ex:lender-2-share a pty:GroupMembership ;
    pty:memberOf ex:lenders ; pty:memberOccupancy ex:lender-2-occ ; pty:share "0.4"^^xsd:decimal .

# ==== Bound meaning: owned by the facility ===================================
#
# What instantiation produces from the stated meaning, the wording's values and the
# instance's parties (a derived artefact, ADR-A92). Each bound term is part of
# exactly one instrument version (ins:boundIn) and bound from exactly one
# stated term (I2). Its relations belong to it and name occupancies and
# groups, never roles. Only bound meaning is evaluated (I13).
#
# A bound relation restates its template's content in full, not only what
# differs. RDF has no override: a relation naming both the template's role and
# the bound occupancy as obligor would have two obligors.

ex:term-6-1 a ins:Term ; ins:boundIn ex:facility-v1 ; ins:boundFrom tmpl:term-6-1 .
ex:repay a ins:Obligation ;
    ins:boundFrom tmpl:repay ;
    ins:arisesUnder ex:term-6-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:borrower-occ ;
    ins:obligee ex:lenders ;                       # owed severally: pty:SeveralOnly
    ins:activity ins-voc:Repay .

ex:term-7-1 a ins:Term ; ins:boundIn ex:facility-v1 ; ins:boundFrom tmpl:term-7-1 .
ex:leverage a ins:ContinuingObligation ;
    ins:boundFrom tmpl:leverage ;
    ins:arisesUnder ex:term-7-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:borrower-occ ;
    ins:obligee ex:lenders , ex:trustee-occ ;      # the trustee benefits, and is no party
    ins:maintains ex:leverage-ok .

ex:term-8-1 a ins:Term ; ins:boundIn ex:facility-v1 ; ins:boundFrom tmpl:term-8-1 .
ex:negative-pledge a ins:Prohibition ;
    ins:boundFrom tmpl:negative-pledge ;
    ins:arisesUnder ex:term-8-1 ;
    ins:obligor ex:borrower-occ ;
    ins:obligee ex:lenders ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:CreateSecurity .
ex:permitted-liens a ins:Permission ;
    ins:boundFrom tmpl:permitted-liens ;
    ins:arisesUnder ex:term-8-1 ;
    ins:holder ex:borrower-occ ;
    ins:counterparty ex:lenders ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:CreateSecurity ;
    ins:excepts ex:negative-pledge ;
    ins:scope ex:lien-by-law .

ex:term-10-1 a ins:Term ; ins:boundIn ex:facility-v1 ; ins:boundFrom tmpl:term-10-1 .
ex:accelerate a ins:Power ;
    ins:boundFrom tmpl:accelerate ;
    ins:arisesUnder ex:term-10-1 ;
    ins:holder ex:lenders ;
    ins:counterparty ex:borrower-occ ;
    ins:activity ins-voc:DeclareDue .
